{"id":"monstruo","lemma":"monstruo","pos":"noun","rank":1088,"glosses":["monster, beast, behemoth","juggernaut","monster, reprehensible person."],"ipa":"/ˈmonstɾwo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-monstruo.wav/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-monstruo.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"monstruos"},"examples":[{"text":"Hay un monstruo debajo de mi cama.","en":"There's a monster under my bed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608557","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},null,null,null,{"g":"my"},{"g":"bed"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"below"]]},{"text":"No eres un monstruo.","en":"You aren't a monster.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ahí solía vivir un monstruo espantoso.","en":"A hideous monster used to live there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687774","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"ghastly"}]},{"text":"Un monstruo gigante viene bajando la montaña.","en":"A huge monster is coming down the mountain.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"giant"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"to go down, come down","l":"bajar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"mountain"}]},{"text":"Comúnmente a los niños pequeños le gustan los libros sobre dragones y otros monstruos.","en":"Small children often like books about dragons and other monsters.","words":[{"g":"commonly"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},{"g":"small","l":"pequeño"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"book","l":"libro"},{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"dragon","l":"dragón"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null]}]}